16:34.030 --> 16:36.830
Namun, kenapa ada kesan minyak pada luka?

16:40.270 --> 16:41.200
Tolong!

16:41.350 --> 16:42.240
Tolong!

16:53.550 --> 16:54.270
Apa pun,

16:54.270 --> 16:55.830
